sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client<br/>(via KServe)
    participant FastAPI as FastAPI Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP<br/>Optional TLS
    participant Rust as Rust Frontend<br/>(PyO3)
    participant Input as InputProcessor
    participant ZMQ1 as ZMQ PUSH<br/>(IPC)
    participant Engine as EngineCore<br/>Scheduler
    participant Exec as Model Executor<br/>CPU Backend
    participant ZMQ2 as ZMQ PUB<br/>(IPC)
    participant Output as OutputProcessor
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over FastAPI,HF: Flow 1: Chat Completion Request

    Client->>FastAPI: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Optional Bearer Token
    FastAPI->>Rust: Tokenize + render chat template
    Rust-->>FastAPI: Tokenized input
    FastAPI->>Input: Processed request
    Input->>ZMQ1: msgspec serialized
    ZMQ1->>Engine: PUSH to EngineCore
    Engine->>Exec: Schedule batch<br/>PagedAttention KV cache
    Exec->>Exec: PyTorch CPU inference<br/>NUMA-aware allocation
    Exec-->>Engine: Tensor output
    Engine->>ZMQ2: PUB result
    ZMQ2->>Output: msgspec deserialized
    Output-->>FastAPI: Formatted response
    FastAPI-->>Client: JSON / SSE stream

    Note over FastAPI,HF: Flow 2: Model Loading at Startup

    FastAPI->>HF: GET model config + weights<br/>TLS 1.2+ / HF_TOKEN Bearer
    HF-->>FastAPI: safetensors / torch files
    FastAPI->>Exec: BaseModelLoader<br/>15+ format plugins
    Exec->>Exec: Memory-map weights<br/>NUMA-aware CPU placement

    Note over FastAPI,HF: Flow 3: gRPC Inference

    participant GRPC as gRPC Server<br/>50051/TCP<br/>Insecure

    Client->>GRPC: GenerateRequest (protobuf)
    GRPC->>Input: Processed request
    Input->>ZMQ1: msgspec serialized
    ZMQ1->>Engine: PUSH to EngineCore
    Engine->>Exec: Schedule + execute
    Exec-->>Engine: Result
    Engine->>ZMQ2: PUB result
    ZMQ2->>Output: msgspec deserialized
    Output-->>GRPC: GenerateResponse
    GRPC-->>Client: Unary / Stream response
